data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Title: Hours and Directions\nURL: https://www.nepenthe.com/directions-and-hours\nPublished: N/A\nAuthor: N/A\nHighlights:\n## Nepenthe Restaurant - Open 365 days a year\n\nOpen daily for full service dining from 11:30am-10:00pm - Lunch 11:30 am - 4:30 pm and Dinner 5:00 pm to 10:00 pm Closed for dinner Thanksgiving and Christmas\n\n...\n\n## Directions and Maps for Visiting Nepenthe\n\nNepenthe is located on the Big Sur Coast with spectacular views of over 60 miles of the coast . Situated on the ocean side of Highway 1, our property is 29 miles South of Carmel and 63 miles North of San Simeon.\n\nBetween these two points, Highway 1 is a spectacular, scenic coastal highway. Our sign, driveway and parking area are directly adjacent to Highway 1. You can't miss us!\n\n...\n\nBig Sur is beautiful in the summer and the days are ... , you'll be able to ... its majestic views, unencumbered ... and ... you plan your visit for the off peak season ... to ... . In addition ... many hotels in the ... may offer reduced ... rates\n\n...\n\nNepenthe 48510 Highway One - Big Sur - California - 93920 831.667.2345 Email Nepenthe (hello@example.test) - Email Phoenix (hello@example.test)\n\n---\n\nTitle: Nepenthe\nURL: https://www.nepenthe.com/\nPublished: N/A\nAuthor: N/A\nHighlights:\nThe Nepenthe property consists of Nepenthe restaurant, Café Kevah and The Phoenix Shop. We look forward to seeing you soon.\n\nNepenthe - open daily 11:30am -10:00pm - Lunch from 11:30am to 4:30pm and Dinner from 5:00pm to 10:00pm (closes at 5:00 pm on Thanksgiving Day and Christmas Day) Café Kevah - open daily, weather permitting, Breakfast from 9:00 am to 12:00 pm. Lunch from 9:00 am to 2:30 pm. Beverages and baked goods from 9:00 am to 3:oo pm.\n\nGift Certificates for Nepenthe and Café Kevah can be purchased here. The Phoenix Shop - open daily 10:30am-6:00pm Closes at 5:00pm on Thanksgiving Day, Christmas Eve and Christmas Day\n\n \n\n TICKETS AVAILABLE NOW!\n\n---\n\nTitle: Reservations and Hours — Nepenthe\nURL: https://www.nepenthe.com/reservations\nPublished: N/A\nAuthor: N/A\nHighlights:\n## Reservations, Special Events, Hours \n\nWe welcome all guests on a walk-in, first come-first serve basis. Unfortunately, we are unable to accommodate requests for lunch or dinner reservations. We look forward to serving you.\n\nFor additional questions, please visit our FAQ Page. \n\nNepenthe is open daily from 11:30 am - 10:00 pm. Lunch 11:30 am - 4:30 pm and Dinner 5:00 pm - 10:00 pm. We are closed for dinner Thanksgiving & Christmas. For Nepenthe and Café Kevah Gift Certificates - please click here. For The Phoenix Shop Gift Certificates - please call 831-667-2347. Gift Certificates are non-transferable between restaurants and gift shop.\n\nNepenthe 48510 Highway One - Big Sur - California - 93920 831.667.2345 Email Nepenthe (hello@example.test) - Email Phoenix (hello@example.test)\n\n---\n\nTitle: Nepenthe - Big Sur CA\nURL: https://www.facebook.com/nepenthebigsur/\nPublished: N/A\nAuthor: N/A\nHighlights:\nNepenthe Big Sur | Big Sur CA | Facebook\nFacebook\n[\nLog In\n](https://www.facebook.com/login/device-based/regular/login/?login_attempt=1&next=https://www.facebook.com/nepenthebigsur/)\nLog In\n[Forgot\n\n---\n\nTitle: Nepenthe in Big Sur, CA United States - Apple Maps\nURL: https://maps.apple.com/place?place-id=IA00492A3F018C0B8\nPublished: N/A\nAuthor: N/A\nHighlights:\nNepenthe in Big Sur, CA United States - Apple Maps\n\n...\n\n# Nepenthe\n\nNew American Cuisine · Monterey County, CA\n\nHOURS\n\nClosed\n\n112 RATINGS\n\n97%\n\nACCEPTS\n\nFood & Drink\n\n...\n\nYelp\n\nAtmosphere\n\n...\n\nYelp\n\nExterior\n\nYelp\n\n...\n\nthe\n\n...\n\n### Hours\n\nEvery Day\n\n11:30 AM – 10:00 PM\n\nClosed Now\n\n### Website\n\nphoenixshopbigsur.com\n\n### Phone\n\n+1 (831) 667-2345 (+18316672345)\n\n### Address\n\n48510 Highway One Big Sur, CA 93920 United States","_meta":{"searchTime":936.5}}]},"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1}

